# Search API Endpoints

## Endpoints Covered
- `GET /search/repositories` — Search repos
- `GET /search/users` — Search users
- `GET /search/code` — Search code
- `GET /search/issues` — Search issues

## Rate Limiting
- Search API has a separate, lower rate limit: 30 requests/minute.
- Use small `per_page` values in search tests.

## Test Data
- Search queries in `data/search_constants.py`
- Queries chosen to always return results (popular languages, well-known repos).
